#+TITLE: BricsCAD bootstrap disables SECURELOAD
#+STATUS: NEXT
#+PRIORITY: P1
#+TYPE: bug
#+DEPENDS: native-cad-validation
#+BRANCH: codex/alfe-com-job-drawing

* Evidence
The emitted COM bridge of SCHME job 564204 unconditionally sent SECURELOAD=0
before runtime loading. The batch SCR emitter contains the same legacy rule.

* Implementation
The COM bridge now approves only the invocation runtime directory through
TRUSTEDPATHS and restores the original value before cleanup, without changing
SECURELOAD. Emitter regression checks pass; native COM validation remains.
The separate batch emitter still needs its own correction and validation.
